OL,14,G0232 The Documentary
OL,15,     FThere are more than 730 sinkholes
OL,16,     Fin central Turkey, and their
OL,17,     Fnumbers are surging, threatening
OL,18,     Ffarmland and food supplies. They
OL,19,     Fare nature's response to
OL,20,     Funsustainable water use.
